WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:04.820
Please don't feel singled out, special,

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.710
or view yourself as a chosen one.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.970
She bites everyone.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:13.261
This is just the inherent
nature of the beast.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.170
There is absolutely no truth
to the persistent myths

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.130
that mosquitoes fancy females over males,

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.100
that they prefer blondes and redheads

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.863
over those with darker hair,

00:00:25.863 --> 00:00:28.555
or that the darker or
more leathery your skin,

00:00:28.555 --> 00:00:31.040
the safer you are from her bite.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.150
It is true, however, that
she does play favorites

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.530
and feasts on some more than others.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:40.750
Blood type O seems to
be the vintage of choice

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.770
over types A and B or their blend.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.840
People with blood type O get bitten

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.830
twice as often as those with type A,

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:52.050
with type B falling somewhere in between.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.535
Disney-Pixar must have done their homework

00:00:54.535 --> 00:00:56.651
when portraying a tipsy mosquito

00:00:56.651 --> 00:00:59.142
ordering a Bloody Mary, O-positive

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:02.541
in the 1998 movie "A Bug's Life."

00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:05.430
Those who have higher natural
levels of certain chemicals

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:08.560
in their skin, particularly lactic acid,

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.950
also seem to be more attractive.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.520
From these elements, she can analyze

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.420
which blood type you are.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.930
These are the same
chemicals that determine

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.590
an individual's level of skin
bacteria and unique body odor.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.700
While you may offend others
and perhaps yourself,

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:29.440
in this case, being pungently
rancid is a good thing,

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.350
for it increases bacteria
levels on the skin,

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:35.380
which make you less
alluring to mosquitoes.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.210
Cleanliness is not next to godliness,

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.650
except for stinky feet,
which emit a bacterium,

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:44.750
the same one that ripens
and rinds certain cheeses,

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.770
that is a mosquito aphrodisiac.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:50.650
Mosquitoes are also enticed by deodorants,

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:54.280
perfumes, soaps, and
other applied fragrances.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.050
While this may seem unfair to many of you,

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.260
and the reason remains a mystery,

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.800
she also has an affinity
for beer drinkers.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:06.820
Wearing bright colors is
also not a wise choice,

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.620
since she hunts by both sight and smell,

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.060
the latter depending chiefly
on the amount of carbon dioxide

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.790
exhaled by the potential target.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:19.240
So all your thrashing
and huffing and puffing

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:24.130
only magnetizes mosquitoes
and puts you at greater risk.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:28.640
She can smell carbon dioxide
from over 200 feet away.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:32.950
When you exercise, for example,
you emit more carbon dioxide

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:36.020
through both frequency
of breath and output.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:39.900
You also sweat, releasing
those appetizing chemicals,

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.970
primarily lactic acid,

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.890
that invites the mosquito's attention.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.900
Lastly, your body temperature rises,

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.160
which is an easily
identifiable heat signature

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.580
for your soon-to-be tormentor.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:57.690
On average, pregnant women
suffer twice as many bites,

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:01.230
as they respire 20% more carbon dioxide

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.710
and have a marginally
elevated body temperature.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:07.040
As we will see, this is bad news

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.540
for the mother and the fetus

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:12.110
when it comes to infection
from Zika and malaria.

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.330
Please don't go on a shower,
deodorant, and exercise strike

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.250
or shelve your beloved beer
and bright T-shirts just yet.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.420
Unfortunately, 85% of what makes you

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.870
attractive to mosquitoes is prewired

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.840
in your genetic circuit board,

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.944
whether that be blood
type, natural chemical,

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:35.944
bacteria or CO2 levels,
metabolism, or stink and stench.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.600
At the end of the day, she will find blood

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.850
from any exposed target of opportunity.

